'''Junimo Woods''' is a [[Locations|location]] that is a Community Center route exclusive that becomes accessible after finishing it. 

It is a maze that can be tricky to traverse but at the bottom of the map through the maze is many helpful shops and fishing. Foragables are scattered through the map to find within the maze. 

Access to this location is first only possible through a warp on the ground located in the southwest corner of [[Cindersap Forest]] and south of the [[Stardew:Hat Mouse|Hat Mouse]]. Later on, a warp can be created after having access to the [[Enchanted Grove]].

